{"4481160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Card Retrieve", "steam_appid": 4481160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481160/extras/8cadd559ab2963fdf3877bad9ae810a6.avif?t=1776448353\" alt=\"Story\" width=256 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once upon a time, there was a young and talented dog magician named Ace, performing his best magic tricks on stage. Suddenly, <strong>POOF!</strong> His assistant opens a portal by mistake. Ace slips and lands in the private chamber of the Cat Empurror <strong>himself, </strong>and sees something he shouldn't have. The embarrassed Empurror brands Ace a criminal. Ace escapes the castle only to find themselves in a cat filled Japan-like kingdom. The secret to getting home is in the Empurror's chambers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481160/extras/8229e81ea4bd0e8cbbe239ee243dc501.poster.avif?t=1776448353\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=544 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481160/extras/8229e81ea4bd0e8cbbe239ee243dc501.webm?t=1776448353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481160/extras/8229e81ea4bd0e8cbbe239ee243dc501.mp4?t=1776448353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481160/extras/4ef3ac4fa7eb6029997895c7132be49b.avif?t=1776448353\" alt=\"Cards\" width=256 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every great magician keeps a secret up their sleeves. Ace's magical cards that zip &amp; zoom through the air! Tabbs provides services to upgrade &amp; merge cards, simply dash down to her shop! Throw the cards into the magic circle and WOW... A new <strong>rare</strong> and <strong>shiny</strong> card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481160/extras/5dbe8f554e3bc6f86f86c01deea70d38.poster.avif?t=1776448353\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=378 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481160/extras/5dbe8f554e3bc6f86f86c01deea70d38.webm?t=1776448353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481160/extras/5dbe8f554e3bc6f86f86c01deea70d38.mp4?t=1776448353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481160/extras/9f2b1354a6d6922c6766bb61949e7aac.avif?t=1776448353\" alt=\"Toys and Treats\" width=256 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a pocket full of treats and Ace's favourite squeaky toy, you’re ready to go! Run a little faster, jump a little higher, and most of all, be the happiest, tail-wagging pup in the whole wide world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481160/extras/e6b9d119b883f9f8426e28b084d3cdbd.avif?t=1776448353\" alt=\"\"width=1403 height=580 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Features</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♤ Dog VS Cats</p><p class=\"bb_